# Frontend (`big-market-web`)

- Static HTML/CSS/JS only (no React).
- API base: `http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1` (via gateway).
- Dev server: `./scripts/web-start.sh` → `http://127.0.0.1:5173`.
- Use staged activity id from the API; do not hardcode a stale activity.
- Logout: call `POST /auth/logout` before clearing local token storage.
- Playwright should assert API business codes where possible, not only UI visibility.
